sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Caller
participant App as Protected application boundary
participant Gate as Authentication and ownership gate
participant Store as Data store
Caller->>App: Personal request with JWT and possible client owner id
App->>Gate: Validate signature, expiry and subject
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT
 Gate-->>App: Deny
 App-->>Caller: 401, no feature or provider action
else Valid JWT
 Gate-->>App: Verified account id
 App->>App: Ignore or reject supplied owner id
 alt Collection read or creation
  App->>Store: Query or insert using verified account id
  Store-->>App: Only this account data
  App-->>Caller: Feature response
 else Object request
  App->>Store: Lookup by object id AND verified account id
  alt No owned object
   Store-->>App: Missing owned object
   App-->>Caller: 403 or 404, no mutation
  else Owned object found
   Store-->>App: Owned object
   App->>Store: Perform validated owner-qualified operation
   Store-->>App: Result or rolled-back error
   App-->>Caller: Feature response or error
  end
 end
end
